// New Movie Library - Nylon Guitar - Nylon
// Physically modelled nylon-string guitar with body resonance, 3 layers x 2 round robins.
// 3 velocity layer(s), 2 round robin(s)
// Generated by tools/nml/formats.py. Samples: ../../Samples (keep the library folder intact).

